+#### `--group-by month|category|account`
+
+Instead of the summary, print the total amount per group, ordered by label.
+A month label is `YYYY-MM`. In text format each group is one line,
+`<group> <total>`:
+
+```
+$ python3 -m ledger.cli report --group-by account fixtures/transactions.csv
+Cash Wallet -88.58
+Checking 7919.70
+Savings 4608.67
+Visa Card -17314.63
+```
+
+In JSON format the output is one object whose keys are the group labels and
+whose values are the totals as numbers rounded to cents, for example
+`{"2025-01": -812.4, "2025-02": 1203.55}`. The filters above apply before
+grouping.
+
